he main menu!\n* Songs played in Non-Stop mode will now count towards achievements and rewards.\n* Fixed an issue where the LevelUp animation could cause a game freeze.\n\n## Bug Fixes ##\n* Restored scrolling behavior for most scrollable lists in game (e.g. song list)\n* Returned New High Score / Previous Best Score information to the Score Summary scene.\n* Fixed an issue causing the Playlist Add Song button to become unresponsive.\n* Custom Decals now stick through scene changes and are rotated correctly (remember controls are now in Settings > Interface to enable it!)\n* Fixed an issue where a song would not finish with the map when the map was very short.\n* Improvements to Invaderz for Challenges+\n* Challenges+ scores will be sent to the general leaderboard as long as the configuration doesn't make it easier!\n\n## Multiplayer specific ##\n* Improved synchronization between players in Multiplayer - platform player levels not updating, players remaining in the room who had left etc.\n* Improvements to microphone and audio, including spatialization balancing between lobby and songs\n* Fix for microphone loss when switching rooms\n* Settings > Multiplayer > Fade Audio for Voice Chat now works, automatically turning down the music when someone speaks in Multiplayer (new player default)\n\n## Visuals ##\n* Fixes to Psycho Road stage, HUMBLE experience", "created_date": 1775114922, "id": "26342136475467592", "version": "3.6.1b6", "version_code": 1103, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26342132138801359"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2436558143118760", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26342136475467592"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, 